  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Do not drink wine, Lev. 10:9. He shall separate himself from wine, Num. 6:3. Their wine is the poison of dragons, Deut. 32:33. drink not wine nor strong drink, Judg. 13:4. wine that maketh glad the heart, Ps. 104:15. Wine is a mocker, Prov. 20:1. he that loveth wine … shall not be rich, Prov. 21:17. They that tarry long at the wine, Prov. 23:30. Look not thou upon the wine when it is red, Prov. 23:31. wine maketh merry, Eccl. 10:19. thy wine mixed with water, Isa. 1:22. continue until night, till wine inflame them, Isa. 5:11 (2 Ne. 15:11). They shall not drink wine, Isa. 24:9. they also have erred through wine, Isa. 28:7. drunken, but not with wine, Isa. 29:9 (2 Ne. 27:4). buy wine and milk without money, Isa. 55:1 (2 Ne. 9:50). set before the sons of … Rechabites … wine, Jer. 35:5. they said, We will drink no wine, Jer. 35:6. Neither shall any priest drink wine, Ezek. 44:21. he would not defile himself … with the wine, Dan. 1:8. look to other gods, and love flagons of wine, Hosea 3:1. Whoredom and wine … take away the heart, Hosea 4:11. mountains shall drop down new wine, Joel 3:18.",
